# Frontend 规范

- Prettier：semi, singleQuote, trailingComma es5, tabWidth 2
- 组件 PascalCase，函数/变量 camelCase
- API 调用统一走 `app/api/client.ts`，自动解包 `{code, message, data}`
- 业务 hooks：`useAuth`, `useProducts`, `useGenerate`
- 类型定义放 `types/index.ts`
- 路由：`(auth)/login`, `(dashboard)/dashboard`, `(dashboard)/products`, `(dashboard)/generate`

```typescript
// ✅ 通过 apiClient 调用
const products = await apiClient.get<Product[]>('/products');

// ❌ 避免页面内直接 fetch 且不处理统一响应格式
```
